==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics|[[catastrophe theory]]}} The point at which a [[slow]], [[reversible]] [[change]] becomes [[irreversible]], often with [[dramatic]] [[consequence]]s.
# {{lb|en|sociology}} A point in time when a group rapidly and dramatically changes its [[behavior]] by widely adopting a previously rare practice.
# {{lb|en|climatology}} An [[irreversible]] change in the [[climate system]].
#: {{cot|en|tipping element}}
# The point in [[time]] at which some new [[technology]] becomes [[mainstream]].

